nal","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p098","chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m098-0139","start":139,"end":140,"surface":"瞿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003921","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p098","chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m098-0152","start":152,"end":153,"surface":"瞿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003921","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p098","chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji067-005","subject_person_id":"cbr-p003921","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"cbr-p003939","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p098","quote":"孔子既沒，弟子思慕，有若狀似孔子，弟子相與共立爲師，師之如夫子時也。他日，弟子進問曰：「昔夫子當行，使弟子持雨具，已而果雨。弟子問曰：『夫子何以知之？』夫子曰：『《詩》不云乎？「月離于畢，俾滂沱矣。」昨暮月不宿畢乎？』他日，月宿畢，竟不雨。商瞿年長無子，其母爲取室。孔子使之齊，瞿母請之。孔子曰：『無憂，瞿年四十後當有五丈夫子。』已而果然。問夫子何以知此？」有若默然無以應。弟子起曰：「有子避之，此非子之座也！」"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"瞿母請之","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"按明示父母、其子及娶女為夫人保存，未名家屬不補姓名。鯉稱按孔子自述葬子與顏回父子敘事暫定，不以年齡或傳授順序補世系；來源陳述與獨立史實確證分開。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji067-061","person_id":"cbr-p003921","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-067-disciples"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["商瞿","子木","瞿"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p082","quote":"商瞿，魯人，字子木。少孔子二十九歳。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p083","quote":"孔子傳《易》於瞿，瞿傳楚人馯臂子弘，弘傳江東人矯子庸疵，疵傳燕人周子家豎，豎傳淳于人光子乘羽，羽傳齊人田子莊何，何傳東武人王子中同，同傳菑川人楊何。何元朔中以治易爲漢中大夫。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p098","quote":"孔子既沒，弟子思慕，有若狀似孔子，弟子相與共立爲師，師之如夫子時也。他日，弟子進問曰：「昔夫子當行，使弟子持雨具，已而果雨。弟子問曰：『夫子何以知之？』夫子曰：『《詩》不云乎？「月離于畢，俾滂沱矣。」昨暮月不宿畢乎？』他日，月宿畢，竟不雨。商瞿年長無子，其母爲取室。孔子使之齊，瞿母請之。孔子曰：『無憂，瞿年四十後當有五丈夫子。』已而果然。問夫子何以知此？」有若默然無以應。弟子起曰：「有子避之，此非子之座也！」"}],"rationale":"依篇內明示姓名字稱及局部問答暫接。吳越王稱按夫差句踐連續敘事；第71段夫子指原憲，第90段指代未定。傳易短何分田子莊何與楊何，傳授不當父子；引古人物保留傳說性。冉季字子產不接鄭子產，原憲子思不接孔子後世子思；名錄各條同字子徒、子聲、子上、皙等均保留不同候選，鄭國是此條人名。魯昭公夫人孟子不接戰國孟子。全152段明示姓名首輪已存，未名者、代詞、版本及跨篇身份待覆核。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p082","text":"商瞿，魯人，字子木。少孔子二十九歳。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m082-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"商瞿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003921","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m082-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"子木","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003921","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m082-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003861","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p083","text":"孔子傳《易》於瞿，瞿傳楚人馯臂子弘，弘傳江東人矯子庸疵，疵傳燕人周子家豎，豎傳淳于人光子乘羽，羽傳齊人田子莊何，何傳東武人王子中同，同傳菑川人楊何。何元朔中以治易爲漢中大夫。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003861","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"瞿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003921","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"瞿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003921","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0013","start":13,"end":17,"surface":"馯臂子弘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003922","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"弘","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003922","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0023","start":23,"end":27,"surface":"矯子庸疵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0028","start":28,"end":29,"surface":"疵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003923","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0032","start":32,"end":36,"surface":"周子家豎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"豎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003924","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0042","start":42,"end":46,"surface":"光子乘羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003925","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003925","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0051","start":51,"end":55,"surface":"田子莊何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003926","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003926","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0061","start":61,"end":65,"surface":"王子中同","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003927","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"同","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003927","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"楊何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003928","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:m083-0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003928","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-067-disciples","book_id":"b-shiji-067","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-067-disciples"},{"id":"c-shiji-067-disciples:p098","text":